@adverts13/dsh-auto-model-router README · Budget downgrade is visible：`tokenBudgetPerSession` **defaults to 0 (no budget)** — the cost layer never
forces a downgrade from budget exhaustion, and `downgradeBehavior` is inert.
Set a positive value to cap spend per session:

@adverts13/dsh-auto-model-router README · On-load consultation (no client UI)：The injected lists and values let the user **decide** whether to adjust;
persistent changes still live in `cordis.patch.yml` (the messages say so).
Headless or no-question-channel setups degrade to report-only and never block.
